en-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Osterhaus</surname> <given-names>ADME</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Dolphin and porpoise morbilliviruses are genetically distinct from phocine distemper virus.</article-title><source>Virology</source> <year>1993</year>;<volume>193</volume>:<fpage>1010</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/viro.1993.1217</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8460473</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R5"><label>5. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Van Bressem</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Van Waerebeek</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Jepson</surname> <given-names>P</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Raga</surname> <given-names>JA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Duignan</surname> <given-names>PJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Nielsen</surname> <given-names>O</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>An insight into the epidemiology of dolphin morbillivirus worldwide.</article-title><source>Vet Microbiol</source> <year>2001</year>;<volume>81</volume>:<fpage>287</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>304</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0378-1135(01)00368-6</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11390111</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>G&#x000f3;mez de Segura</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Crespo</surname> <given-names>EA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Pedraza</surname> <given-names>SN</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hammond</surname> <given-names>PS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Raga</surname> <given-names>JA</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Abundance of small cetaceans in the waters of the central Spanish Mediterranean.</article-title><sou